      "operands": "Declared PATH operands accept logical/native identity and --; scalar/text/query/program operands remain data. curl [OPTIONS] URL",
      "encoding": "Exact bytes for streams; captured saved-file encoding/BOM/newline representation for native document inputs; UTF-8 LF for generated text unless stated.",
      "statuses": {
